"<b>{#}</b><span><strong>A path</strong> Week by week through the demos, in the order of the lectures, with the review before each test.</span>",
"<b>{#}</b><span><strong>Required worksheets</strong> One most weeks, marked on the week and on the demo card; the rest stay supplementary.</span>",
"<b>{#}</b><span><strong>Progress</strong> Each worksheet remembers what the student has answered, in their own browser; nothing is sent anywhere.</span>",
"<b>{#}</b><span><strong>Canvas</strong> A Common Cartridge file for the course, so every demo and worksheet sits in the LMS week by week.</span>",
"<b>{#}</b><span><strong>The same demos</strong> A demo opened from a course shows that course’s worksheets and steps to the next demo in the course. Opened from the library, it is the plain demo.</span>",
